        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Jones, Harvey Schmidt\n- Works: The Fantasticks (film), The Fantasticks, Philemon\n- Topics: Off-Broadway, musical theatre\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Jones was born in 1928 in Littlefield, Texas.\n- Tom Jones is an American lyricist and often a librettist of musical theatre.\n- Tom Jones and Harvey Schmidt created The Fantasticks as an off-Broadway production of the same name.\n- The Fantasticks ran for 17,162 performances and was later revived off-Broadway.\n- The screenplay for The Fantasticks film was written by Tom Jones and Harvey Schmidt and was based on their off-Broadway production.\n- Philemon is a 1975 Off-Broadway musical by Tom Jones and Harvey Schmidt.",
